// Spanish names and a one-line "what it asks the player" for each attack type. PURELY COSMETIC:
// the real list of types, their fields and their defaults comes from Unity
// (modules/boss-catalog.js, generated by BossCatalogExporter.cs). A type Unity knows and this file
// does not simply shows its C# name — nothing breaks, so a new archetype needs no edit here.

